G" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260608/zhanbao_image_1982275_1780865198_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260608/zhanbao_image_1982275_1780865198_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">十人意大利在友谊赛中1-0战胜希腊。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-08/match1982270date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">克罗地亚2-1绝杀斯洛文尼亚 40岁莫德里奇贴地斩佩里西奇助攻</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260608/zhanbao_image_1982270_1780864962_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260608/zhanbao_image_1982270_1780864962_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260608/zhanbao_image_1982270_1780864962_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">克罗地亚2-1绝杀斯洛文尼亚，本场为克罗地亚世界杯前最后一场友谊赛，克罗地亚将在小组赛首轮对阵英格兰。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-08/match1968304date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">平分秋色！摩洛哥1-1挪威 马兹拉维疑似伤退迪亚斯厄德高破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260608/zhanbao_image_1968304_1780865978_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260608/zhanbao_image_1968304_1780865978_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260608/zhanbao_image_1968304_1780865978_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">阿布德反击助攻迪亚斯破门，鲍勃助攻厄德高劲射扳平比分，最终摩洛哥队以1-1战平挪威队。</span></p><p><strong>【皇马主席竞选】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-08/6a258bf3088b8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">击败里克尔梅！官方：79岁弗洛伦蒂诺获胜，他将继续担任皇马主席</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260607/202606072324123430.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260607/202606072324123430.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260607/202606072324123430.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">皇马官方宣布，79岁的现任俱乐部主席弗洛伦蒂诺在竞选中战胜里克尔梅，他将继续担任皇马主席直至2030年。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-08/6a25f61c4a9b7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">穆帅宣布老佛爷获胜！皇马发布会现场，穆帅出镜：是的，当然！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260608/202606080653507274_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260608/202606080653507274_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260608/202606080653507274_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">皇马竞选计票结束后，弗洛伦蒂诺举行发布会，在开场，首先播出的是穆帅几秒钟的视频，穆帅简单地说了一句：是的，当然！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-08/6a25f73a17db6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">弗洛伦蒂诺现场宣布：自豪地宣布世界上最好教练之一——穆帅回归</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.15" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260608/202606080657263147.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.15" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-i