e92c11enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">丹麦队医：埃里克森自己从球场走下来了，他托我告诉大家他没事</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260608/202606080221134790_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260608/202606080221134790_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260608/202606080221134790_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">在今日凌晨进行的丹麦vs乌克兰的友谊赛中，埃里克森突然晕倒，随后经队医处理被送往医院，比赛取消。丹麦官方通报，埃里克森情况良好。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-08/6a25b70745fb1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">好在没事！埃里克森5年前曾遭突发心脏骤停，如今再次在场上晕厥</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260608/202606080214051441.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260608/202606080214051441_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260608/202606080214051441_720.jpg"> </div><p>5年前，埃里克森就曾在球场上突然